  Nickname: 
  Occupation: Clerk
  CharacterDescription: Expressionless, monotone voice
  CharacterArc: "Expressionless, with a monotone voice. He represents a youth already
    burnt out by the scarcity and long lines of 1990. He isn't angry like the older
    generation; he is simply empty. He treats the checkpoint like just another line
    he\u2019s forced to stand in, displaying a \"quiet quitter\" energy before the
    term existed."
  DateOfBirth: 03/03/1968
  Sex: Male
